# server image: QEMU with SPICE (VM console), USB redirection, virtfs shares and VNC; the same lines app-emulation/horcrux-bin installs on a machine
app-emulation/qemu spice usbredir virtfs vnc zstd
# podman -> netavark builds its firewall rules through the nftables json interface; same line horcrux-repo-config ships in horcrux-roles.use
net-firewall/nftables json
# SAN storage on every server: iSCSI, dm-multipath, NVMe-oF, lvmlockd + sanlock (horcrux-bin[san]); same lines horcrux-repo-config ships in horcrux-roles.use
app-emulation/horcrux-bin san
sys-fs/lvm2 lvm sanlock
